Subject: [PATCH 23/30] lxmd: LXMF propagation node (opt-in)

Optional lxmd propagation node for operators who want to run one, off by
default (S85lxmd reads /etc/rnsbox/lxmd.conf `enabled=no` and is gated on
/run/clock-synced like rnsd). Attaches to the shared local Reticulum
instance; kept RAM-conscious since the board is memory-constrained.
---
